title: "SkillWorks: Claude Code artefacts by category and kind"
abstract: "A structural census of the public Claude Code artefact ecosystem, aggregated to one row per category and artefact kind: how many listings the index holds, how many distinct repositories they came from, how many do not parse into something Claude Code could load, and the mean of the 0-100 score."
